### CinemaAbyss All Services HTTP Tests
### RFC 2616 compliant HTTP requests for testing all CinemaAbyss services
### Comprehensive test suite for the entire microservices architecture

### Variables
@monolithUrl = http://localhost:8080
@moviesUrl = http://localhost:8081
@eventsUrl = http://localhost:8082
@proxyUrl = http://localhost:8000

### ===========================================
### System Health Check (All Services)
### ===========================================

### Monolith Health
GET {{monolithUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Movies Service Health
GET {{moviesUrl}}/api/movies/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Events Service Health
GET {{eventsUrl}}/api/events/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Proxy Service Health
GET {{proxyUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### ===========================================
### End-to-End User Journey Tests
### ===========================================

### 1. User Registration Flow
### Create User via Monolith
POST {{monolithUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "username": "e2e_user",
  "email": "e2e@example.com"
}

###

### Create User Event
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/events/user
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "username": "e2e_user",
  "action": "registered",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:00:00Z"
}

###

### 2. Movie Management Flow
### Create Movie via Monolith
POST {{monolithUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "E2E Test Movie",
  "description": "End-to-end test movie",
  "rating": 8.5,
  "genres": ["Drama", "Test"]
}

###

### Create Movie via Movies Service
POST {{moviesUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "E2E Movies Service Movie",
  "description": "Movie created via movies microservice",
  "rating": 9.0,
  "genres": ["Action", "Test"]
}

###

### Create Movie Event
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/events/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "movie_id": 1,
  "title": "E2E Test Movie",
  "action": "added",
  "user_id": 1,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
}

###

### 3. Payment Processing Flow
### Create Payment via Monolith
POST {{monolithUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "amount": 29.99
}

###

### Create Payment Event
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/events/payment
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "payment_id": 1,
  "user_id": 1,
  "amount": 29.99,
  "status": "successful",
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T11:00:00Z",
  "method_type": "credit_card"
}

###

### 4. Subscription Management Flow
### Create Subscription via Monolith
POST {{monolithUrl}}/api/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "plan_type": "premium",
  "start_date": "2024-01-15T00:00:00Z",
  "end_date": "2024-02-15T00:00:00Z"
}

###

### ===========================================
### Proxy Service Integration Tests
### ===========================================

### Movies via Proxy (Load Balanced)
GET {{proxyUrl}}/api/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Users via Proxy (Direct to Monolith)
GET {{proxyUrl}}/api/users
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Create Movie via Proxy (Load Balanced)
POST {{proxyUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "Proxy Load Balanced Movie",
  "description": "Movie created via proxy with load balancing",
  "rating": 8.8,
  "genres": ["Thriller", "Proxy"]
}

###

### Create User via Proxy (Direct to Monolith)
POST {{proxyUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "username": "proxy_integration_user",
  "email": "proxy@example.com"
}

###

### ===========================================
### Data Consistency Tests
### ===========================================

### Compare Movies from Monolith vs Movies Service
GET {{monolithUrl}}/api/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

GET {{moviesUrl}}/api/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

### Compare Movies via Proxy (should route to either service)
GET {{proxyUrl}}/api/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

###

