### ===========================================
### Error Handling and Edge Cases
### ===========================================

### Invalid JSON
POST {{monolithUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "username": "test",
  "email": "test@example.com"
  // Missing closing brace

###

### Missing Content-Type
POST {{monolithUrl}}/api/movies
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "title": "Test Movie",
  "description": "Test Description"
}

###

### Large Payload
POST {{eventsUrl}}/api/events/movie
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: CinemaAbyss-Test-Client/1.0

{
  "movie_id": 999,
  "title": "Very Long Movie Title That Exceeds Normal Length Limits And Tests The System's Ability To Handle Extended String Values In JSON Payloads For Performance And Stability Testing",
  "action": "viewed",
  "user_id": 999,
  "timestamp": "2024-01-15T15:00:00Z"
}

###

